# No internal names in this config

This repo is a public Neovim config. Nothing in it may identify an employer, product, customer, cluster, or real environment.

## Do not add

- Product or company names
- Cluster names, kube contexts, namespaces, secret names, service names, hostnames
- Real connection URLs, usernames, passwords, tokens, or ports tied to a real deploy
- Comments or docs that point at a private repo path

## Do

- Generic tools and mechanisms: `kubectl`, port-forward, `localhost`, `psql`
- Examples use placeholders: `NAMESPACE`, `SECRET`, `127.0.0.1`

Editor behavior may assume a large Go monorepo (build tags, lint cost). Do not name that repo. If a request is motivated by a private checkout, implement only the generic version here.
